translation.sessionStatus.sleepingIncreaseLimit	Devin is sleeping. To wake Devin up, [increase your limit](/settings/plans)
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingIncreaseOrgLimit	Devin is sleeping. To wake Devin up, [increase your organization's limit](/organizations/{{orgId}})
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingIncreaseUserLimit	Devin is sleeping. To wake Devin up, ask your account admin to increase your usage limit
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingNetworkConfig	Devin went to sleep to apply the updated network config
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingNoQuotaAllocation	Devin is sleeping because your account is on an individual plan but you are not the organization owner. Check your [plans](/settings/plans) for details.
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingOrgUsageLimitExceeded	Devin is sleeping due to organization usage settings. An enterprise admin must increase the ACU limit for your organization to continue.
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingOutOfCredits	Devin is sleeping because your account is out of credits. Please check your billing details.
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingOutOfQuota	Devin is sleeping because {{description}}. Check your [usage settings](/settings/usage) for details.
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingPaymentDeclined	Devin is sleeping because your organization's last payment failed. To wake Devin up, please [update your payment details](/settings/plans)
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingRenewSubscription	Devin is sleeping. To wake Devin up, [manage your subscription](/settings/plans)
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingTotalSessionLimitExceeded	Devin is sleeping because this session exceeded the total session ACU limit. Acknowledge the limit to continue or start a new session.
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingUsageLimitExceeded	Devin hit your per-message usage limit, so it automatically paused to prevent runaway spend. Want it to keep going? Send a message, or raise or remove the limit in [usage settings](/settings/usage?tab=limits).
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingUserInactivity	Devin is sleeping due to inactivity. Wake Devin up by sending a message
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingUserUsageLimitExceeded	Devin is sleeping because your per-user ACU limit was exceeded. Ask your account admin to increase your usage limit to continue.
translation.sessionStatus.sleepingWakeByMessage	Devin is sleeping. Wake Devin up by sending a message
translation.sessionStatus.waking	Devin is waking up.
